    "text": "Top Deck Magazine came with English cards stamped with the \"W\" of Wizards of the Coast: Fossil's Kabuto with the December 1999 issue, Base Set 2's Wartortle with the March 2000 issue, Gym Heroes' Misty's Psyduck with the August 2000 issue and Gym Challenge's Brock's Vulpix with the March 2001 issue. The February 2000 issue came with an oversize copy of Base Set's Pikachu.",
